  ],
  "comments": 0,
  "content_html": "<p><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 13pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">MAGIBIN</span></p><p></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><i>Dangerous Magic Mite</i></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;\"><i><img alt=\"\" height=\"410\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiaNu1wCRK_g2DLBIBHIgRfwCbtkbT4erzPZBZiKBUhz31hbeqdXvgqcixV1PTcgqPzQEPl8l1y66uQ6v5zxJL-LPa_CJrGUr99aYZdxtHOfR8RlCKkMNoxKnzhBOjKB00fynnKy6mOD8cwwBNhD8EztJ-WSRPJ_Omm3tMwGUBA4gnsdqF3XUy9FEYVxmbo\" width=\"640\" /> <br /></i></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><i>&nbsp; </i><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Introduction</span></p><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The magic of a powerful spell caster can linger after their passing. Occasionally a bit of desire or malice will attach to these arcane fragments and cause them to form into mischievous mage that's more dangerous than it seems.<span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></h3><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Magibin are stubby humanoids clothed in oversized robes and hats whose only notable features are a pair of brightly glowing eyes.</span></h3></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Menace Level</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Mega-Boss</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Rank</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\">8</p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Home Region/Habitat</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Magibin often form in towers, archives, ruins, really anywhere a powerful wizard, sorcerer or witch might have dwelt in. They don't always remain in these places though.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Aptitudes (Clever, Swift, Annoying: +3 Insight, -2 Aura)</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Primary Aptitudes: </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Insight</span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">, Deftness, Grit</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Secondary Aptitudes: </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Might, Aura</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Might [8] </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: xx-small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">-1 (small)</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Deftness [13] </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: xx-small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">(</span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: xx-small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">+1 small)</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Grit [11]</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Insight [14]</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Aura [8]</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Combat Values</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Hearts [5]</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Attack [+6]</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Speed [Normal]</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Defense Rating [15] </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: xx-small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">(Spell Form, Small)</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Adversary Info</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Type:&nbsp;</span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Monster</span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">, Manifestation</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b>Size: </b>Small</li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b>Allegiance: </b>Twilight (2 Bright, 2 Dark)</li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">&nbsp;</span></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Abilities</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Conjured Corpus (Basic, Magic)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Magibin are diminutive entities formed of spell fragments, desire, and whimsical malice.</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px; text-align: left;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Consolas, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier;\">Magibin can only be harmed by weapons made of Magical Materials or by Magical Abilities.</span></span></li><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier;\">+4 Defense Rating</span></span></li><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier;\">Magibin have an <b>Edge</b> on all Insight Rolls.&nbsp;</span></span></li><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier;\">The Sage Ability <b>Demystify</b> (and other, similar effects, at GM's discretion) can destroy a Magibin instantly if successfully used against this Ability. This will always be contested against the Magibin's Insight.</span></span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: courier; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Bothersome Blink (Legendary, Magic)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Magibins don't move it he same way other creatures do, instead they seem to vanish and reappear elsewhere at will.</span></p><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Magibin are capable of short-range teleportation in addition to normal movement. When utilizing it they can move to an adjacent area and ignore the concerns of terrain, such as the Isolated and Precarious Battlefield Conditions. The one exception is that they need solid ground to teleport onto.&nbsp;</span></span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If the Magibin is successfully struck by an Attack (or other instance requiring an Attack Roll) they may make a Deftness Check. On a success, they reflexively blink to an adjacent area and avoid harm.</span></span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This Ability also grants the Magibin an Edge on Deftness rolls for getting out of the way of danger, such dodging a grenade.&nbsp;</span></span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grants 1 Bright Allegiance&nbsp;</span></span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana; white-space: pre-wrap;\">GM Note: This is a powerful Ability. Players can and should try to get clever to mitigate it (such as using Reaction actions to try and catch a teleporting Magibin unaware).</span></span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Hocus Hijack (Legendary, Magic)</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Redirecting someone else's spells is really quite simple if you're mostly made of the same stuff.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\">Magibin may attempt a hijack whenever someone hostile targets them with a magical Ability that calls for a contest and inflicts an undesired effect.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\">This incurs a contest between the Magibin's Insight and the Ability user's Aura.</span></li><ul><li><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\"><b>Success:&nbsp;</b>If the Magibin wins the contest, they may choose someone within 2 Areas of them (including the original user of the Ability). The use of the Ability is then resolved normally, save for it now affects the Magibin's chosen target instead of them.</span></li></ul><li><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\">Grants 1 Bright Allegiance&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Wizardly Wrack (Legendary, Magic)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">With a flick of the wrist Magibin can violently agitate the mana in an area, creating a rather chaotic shockwave.</span></p><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier;\">Magibin may use this ability to target a battlefield area up to 2 areas away from them. This incurs a contest between the Magibin's Insight and the occupants of that area's Deftness.</span></span></li><ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier;\"><b>Success: </b>Those who lose the the contest against the Magibin take a Heart of damage and are inflicted with a <a href=\"https://breakrpg.blogspot.com/2024/04/freebie-jinxes.html\">random Jinx.</a>&nbsp;This lasts for 24 hours.&nbsp;</span></span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier;\">Those already suffering from a Jinx simply take an additional Heart of damage instead.</span>&nbsp;</span></li></ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Magibin cannot use Wizardly Wrack 2 turns in a row.&nbsp;It takes a bit for their own mana to settle down.&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Magibin themselves are immune to this ability, so they may use it on the area they occupy without risk.</span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grants 1 Dark Allegiance&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Tricky Transmutation (Basic, Magic)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A wave of the hand and a wicked giggle can make an enemy's trusted tools into a liability.</span></p><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\">Magibin may target an enemy up to 2 areas away from them with this ability. This incurs a contest between the Magibin's Insight and the target's Aura.</span></li><ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\"><b>Success:&nbsp;</b>If the Magibin wins the contest, they may choose one piece of gear carried by the target that is visible and not stashed away somehow. They may change the chosen item into another piece of gear in the same category. For example, they could change a Standard Weapon into a Mighty Weapon or a Grenade into a Bomb.</span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\">Items changed this way revert back in 24 hours, or upon the Magibin's destruction.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\">This ability cannot alter items crafted from magical materials.</span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: small;\">Grants 1 Dark Allegiance&nbsp;</span></li></ul><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></div><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Communication Methods</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\">Magibin are able to speak Bright Speech and Dark Tongue. They understand these languages in addition to Low Speech.</p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Tactics</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\">With their strange array of magical powers, Magibin like to draw things out with their defensive abilities and sow chaos. They are big fans of hindering opponents by altering their gear into something they can't use (for example, making a Raider's armor go from light to superheavy, or making the sneak's concealed weapon into a cumbersome mighty weapon). Since they can target enemies from a good distance, they use their <b>Bothersome Blink</b> to keep away from their foes and retreat if things go badly for them. </p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Yield</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\">If slain, Magibin crumble into 3 Units of <b>Arcane Powder </b>(Core Rules, PG 290)</p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Miscellaneous</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Indicators -&nbsp; </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">A strange crackling in the air, high pitched laughter, distorted looking items strewn about.</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Roleplaying Notes - </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">As beings of pure magic, Magibin are not operating on motivations or morality that the folk can comprehend. For the most part, they just want to make trouble and watch the fun: they are childlike in both a whimsical and wicked way.</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Customization&nbsp; -&nbsp; </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Certain Magibin may cause <a href=\"https://breakrpg.blogspot.com/2024/11/freebie-arcane-contamination-syndrom.html\">Odditis symptoms</a> with their <b>Wizardly Wrack</b> ability rather than Jinxes. Some might have Heretic or Sage Abilities as well.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Random Encounter Reaction</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Friendly/Benign (1-5) - </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">This Magibin is listlessly using their magic to change a stray pebble into other shapes. They ask the adventure team to show them something fun - if they acquiesce, the Magibin will clap and leave them alone, perhaps even perform a favor for them</span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">. </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">If they don't, they may turn hostile to stave off further boredom.</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Indifferent/Wary (6-13) - </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">The adventure team comes across a Magibin searching high and low for their companion (another Magibin or Adversary of your choice) as the pair are entertaining themselves with a game of hide and seek. Once the Magibin interacts with the team, the other pops up and declares them the loser. If the party cannot settle the ensuing argument, they'll get blamed for it and have a fight on their hands.</span></p></li><li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; list-style-type: disc; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Hostile/Bloodthirsty (14-20) - </span><span face=\"Arial,sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">A Magibin suddenly appears in front of the adventure team and attacks. They were waiting nearby and are attempting an ambush (Core Rules, PG 252) because they think one of the characters is annoying for some innocuous reason, likely their quirk or one of their traits.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 8pt;\"><span face=\"'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Variants and Related Entries</span></h3>Replacing Conjured Corpus with a Species Ability can create a chaos magic using wizard of sorts."
}
